                "is_external_url": true,
                "author": "Andy Chalk",
                "contents": "I just made a noise like air being slowly released from a <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Vr18dPC2hfs\" target=\"_blank\">balloon</a>... <a href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/games/adventure/a-great-indie-studio-is-making-a-sequel-to-one-of-my-favorite-adventures-17-years-later-for-one-simple-reason-were-not-getting-any-younger-and-the-world-seems-to-be-ending/?utm_source=steam&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\">Read more.</a>",
