                "contents": "Some stories end. Others are waiting to return.In 2009, Josef the robot was thrown onto a scrapheap and found his way back into the city to save his girlfriend Berta. Now, they are searching for a new home. Where the road leads, and who they might meet along the way\u2026 you\u2019ll find out soon. The Machinarium Team is Back Together \ud83e\uddbeThe same people who brought you Machinarium and Samorost 3 have dusted off their toolboxes:\ud83d\udd27 Jakub Dvorsk\u00fd returns as the Game Director\ud83c\udfa8 Adolf Lachman is creating handcrafted backgrounds and characters\ud83c\udf00 V\u00e1clav Bl\u00edn is bringing it all to life with his charming animations\ud83c\udfb5 Tom\u00e1\u0161 Dvo\u0159\u00e1k aka Floex is composing the soundtrackThe team is bigger, more experienced, but still full of love for the world of Machinarium.Spread the WordThis is a huge moment for us, and the best way to support the game right now is simple:\u2b50 Wishlist and follow Machinarium 2 here on Steam\ud83d\udce3 Tell your friends that Machinarium 2 is coming, and send them our Announcement Trailer\ud83e\uddf2 Follow us around the internet: https://linktr.ee/amanitadesignHave you played Machinarium?The original Machinarium is 80% off on Steam until October 15. It's a good time to meet Josef for the first time, or to retrace his steps before the road continues.\u00a0Thank you for waiting with us all these years. There's a lot we aren't ready to show yet, but that won't be the case for long.Clank, clack, bzzt!Volha & Amanita Design\ud83c\udfae Discord | \ud83d\udc26 X/Twitter | \ud83e\udd8b Bluesky | \ud83d\udcf7 Instagram | \ud83c\udfb5 TikTok | \u25b6\ufe0f YouTube | \ud83d\udcd5 Facebook ",
